{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":114730,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that dreamweddings mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79566-do-your-ownflowers-or-get-the-ones-offered-by-the-resort\/?view=findpost&p=1904201\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nI really want to do my own flowers but wondering about traveling with them. Has anyone did either of these. And if so how did it go.\n-----------------------------\n\n@\"lorishultz2016\"\n \nIt really depends on where you are getting married, if you enjoy DIY and you have time.  I do not see why it would be impossible.  I \u00b4ve had in the past a bride fly from the UK to have a DW in the Riviera maya , and had her own bouquet made from artificial flowers only because she wanted to keep it afterwards.   The centerpieces were real flowers made by a local florist.\n \n \nhope this helps\n \nHappy Planning\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441464781,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":114684,"Title":"liked a post you made in Dw Wedding After Postponing...","Message":"Hello!\n\nValentineMrs2Be just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCongratulations I am glad your FH is doing better. And Puerto Rico is really nice. Been there a couple of times. The beaches there are really nice you are going to have a really nice wedding there.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79563-dw-wedding-after-postponing-but-i-am-ok-introducing-me\/?view=findpost&p=1904157\n","Sender":{"Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441394550,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":113074,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tell Me Wedding Planning Do...","Message":"Hello!\n\nhswerdy just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI feel the same way . We want to have our wedding in St Thomas but I want the best hotel and not for sure which one\nto choose. I am so over all this that i dont know where to go next.  \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79540-tell-me-wedding-planning-doesnt-suck\/?view=findpost&p=1903600\n","Sender":{"Id":284587,"Name":"hswerdy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441035056,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":112931,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that jackyrae mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79538-new-bride-for-2017\/?view=findpost&p=1903761\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"lorishultz2016\" I think it would be ok, too. The more I think about it, the more I keep thinking that PLayacar Palace and Dreams Tulum are my top favorites and will be either one I choose. I'm just hoping that my friends (her husband included) wouldn't mind coming back to the Playacar palace again for another wedding. She will definitely be my bridesmaid. I just really loved pretty much everything about the palace and the resort credits are really attracting me there.  So where are you having your wedding at lorishultz\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440980864,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":112692,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that MegLeLy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79526-where-to-go\/?view=findpost&p=1903702\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"lorishultz2016\" \nMy travel agent has been dealing with them so far and while they are slow to respond (few days to a week) they seemed to have good group rates and promotions based on number of rooms booked.   \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440784222,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":111503,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that MegLeLy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79526-where-to-go\/?view=findpost&p=1903405\n\n----------------------------------\nYour welcome @\"lorishultz2016\".    I'm planning my wedding at Dreams La Romana in the Dominican Republic.    \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440541273,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":111082,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding colors","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThank you plum with light purple sounds great together\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/67485-wedding-colors\/?view=findpost&p=1903291\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440449244,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":110498,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"lorishultz2016,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome lorishultz2016 to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello lorishultz2016,<br \/><br \/>Welcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.<br \/><br \/>Here are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.<br \/><br \/>If you have not done so, you may want to:<br \/>complete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)<br \/>visit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/23\/newbies)<br \/>Start your own wedding planning blog (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blogs\/)<br \/>find the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in<br \/><br \/>Here are some links that may be helpful to you:<br \/>Destination Wedding Community & Forum (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/)<br \/>Resort Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/resorts-villas)<br \/>Wedding Vendor Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/wedding-vendors)<br \/>Destination Wedding Tips and Articles (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips)<br \/>Wedding Image Gallery (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/recent\/albums)<br \/>BDW Help Page (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=help)<br \/>BDW Forum Rules and Etiquette (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/8853\/forum-faqs-etiquette-rules)<br \/>How to Download Attachments (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/48545\/update-1-18-2010-downloading-attachments)<br \/><br \/>Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:<br \/><br \/>Moderators and Community Leaders<br \/>Tammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammy-host\/). Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006<br \/>AlexisinJamaica (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255437-alexisinjamaica\/) - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.<br \/><br \/>If you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:<br \/>BDW on Facebook (http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Twitter (http:\/\/twitter.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Pinterest (http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bdwforum\/)<br \/><br \/>If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business, please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com (mailto:advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20Inquiry%20for%20BDW).<br \/><br \/>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read! (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010)<br \/><br \/>Please feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.<br \/><br \/>Team BDW\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=11191#msg20094\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440276497,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11191}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"8","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
