! My boyfriend proposed to me this week and we are already getting married in Maldives in November.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are traveling to London (from Stockholm) for a couple of days in about a week and I really need help to find retain stores in London that sell budget&amp;nbsp;bridal gawns (around 150 pounds) I can find really nice dresses at this price but they are only online stores and I would love a fitting session!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The other issue is that I want to find my fiance a pair of white linen pants, do you have any idea where to go in London?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks all\/ Nazdane&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903764,"PostDate":1441012142,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi every one!<\/p>\n<p>I really need all help I can get! My boyfriend proposed to me this week and we are already getting married in Maldives in November.<\/p>\n<p>We are traveling to London (from Stockholm) for a couple of days in about a week and I really need help to find retain stores in London that sell budget\u00a0bridal gawns (around 150 pounds) I can find really nice dresses at this price but they are only online stores and I would love a fitting session!!<\/p>\n<p>The other issue is that I want to find my fiance a pair of white linen pants, do you have any idea where to go in London?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks all\/ Nazdane<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nazdaneh_n@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"195.67.90.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441011709,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nazdaneh","Id":284627,"Name":"Nazdaneh","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79549","Title":"Budget Weeding Dress And Linen Pants In London","LastPostDate":1441012142},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
